<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103918" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῐθᾰσ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tame, domesticate</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ
				ἥμερα τρέφων καὶ τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				589b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιθασεύοντες τὰ χρήσιμα τῶν ζῴων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					4.3.10
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ὁ ἐλέφας καὶ πειθαρχεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					610a29
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				756b22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμᾶς τιθασεύουσι χειροήθεις ποιοῦντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					3.31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἀνθρώπους εἰς φιλότητας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Lib.</u>
					p.40
				</span></i>
			 O.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ νοσήματα ἐλαφρύνει τε καὶ
			τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.211
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ γυνὴ] ἐτετιθάσευτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					7.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				264a
			</span></i>; of a disease, <i>become milder</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				11.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of trees,
				<i>cultivate</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοτίνους] εἰς
				ἐλαίας ἐξημεροῦντες καὶ τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fab.</u>
				20
			</span></i>. Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιθασός</span> fin.</div>
